{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31883","headline":"送李傅侍郎劒南行营 · 贾岛","name":"送李傅侍郎劒南行营","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"走马从边事，新恩受外台。\n勇看双节出，期破八蛮回。\n许国家无恋，盘江栈不摧。\n移军刁斗逐，报捷劒门开。\n角咽狝猴呌，鼙乾霹雳来。\n去年新甸邑，犹滞佐时才。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贾岛","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31883.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31883","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}